# 统一换行符：仓库内一律 LF，检出时不做转换
# 目的：避免 Windows(CRLF) 与 Mac/Linux(LF) 协作时产生整文件 diff 噪音，
#       也让后续 Docker / CI 构建拿到稳定的 LF 源文件。
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制文件不做任何换行处理
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary

# 明确文本类型，便于 diff 与合并
*.md text
*.json text
*.yml text
*.yaml text
*.js text
*.jsx text
*.ts text
*.tsx text
*.css text
*.html text
*.sql text
*.sh text eol=lf

# Windows 专用脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# 语言统计忽略
package-lock.json linguist-generated=true
pnpm-lock.yaml linguist-generated=true
